/datum/species/dullahan
	desc = "Revenants are those that have died, returning from death to continue 'living' in a manner to speak. Their origins are not entirely known, and many are completely inconsistent: be it from thaumaturgic experiment, accidental discovery, or miracle of the Divine Wills. \
	Unable to truly rest, yet entirely sane of mind. Capable of detaching their heads through unknown arcyne means, they are oft wanderers due to their bizarre origins and being ostracized by both the Temple and many of the common masses around the lands."
